[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、お疲れ様",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030040010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgm": "008"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサー。見とってくれたと！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今日のライブもすごく良かったぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ありがとう……\r\nうち、ずっとこの世界に憧れとったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今は、こんな大きか舞台にも立てるようになったんやね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、けど……恋鐘なら\r\nもっと大きなステージにだって立てるさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、もっと上を目指そう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん……そうやね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちにアイドルばやらせたら\r\n右にでるもんはおらんもんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん……うちひとりやと\r\nきっとここには来れんかったと思うとよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、アイドルはファンの期待や\r\n応援があってこそだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……けど……それだけじゃなか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "地元でうちの歌や踊りを褒めてくれた人\r\nアイドルになれるって言うてくれた実家のお客さん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そういう人たちみんなに、うちはお礼ば言いたか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、こんな素敵なアイドルを\r\n送り届けてくれた人たちに感謝してるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ……そんでそのお礼をいう相手は\r\nうちが東京に来てからずっと傍で支えてくれた……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーもばい",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……\r\nお礼を言うのは、俺の方だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これだけすごいステージを見せてもらって\r\nまだまだ成長する姿も見られるんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……プロデューサー。うちがここまで来れたんも\r\nプロデューサーのおかげなんやけん、少しは誇らんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、俺は当たり前のことをしていただけだし……\r\n特別すごいことなんてしてないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "まったくもう……自分のこと\r\nいっちょんわかっとらんのやけんー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええ？　そうかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、そんなところが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "な、なんでもなか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？　ならいいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、俺だけじゃなくて\r\n地元の人にも恋鐘のステージを見せたいよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　うちの感謝の気持ちをみんなに見てもらう……\r\nそのために長崎凱旋ライブたい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、凱旋ライブか……たしかにいい案だ\r\n前にも恋鐘、言ってたもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、いつになるかはわからないけど必ずやろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も恋鐘が長崎のステージで輝く姿を見たいからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　うちとプロデューサーならすぐにでも\r\n長崎ライブば実現できるばい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちらふたりに叶えられん願いごとなんてなかもん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんで……もしそれが実現した時は……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……好きになってもらうけん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003110230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "長崎のこと……うちと同じくらい\r\n好きになってもらうけん！　楽しみにしとってね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400311/2004003110230"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]